OL,3,AStar Wars actor 'thrilled' to voice the
OL,4,AWelsh Luke Skywalker
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoicing Luke Skywalker in the
OL,7,FWelsh-language version of Star Wars was
OL,8,Fa "dream job" according to actor Osian
OL,9,FMorgan.
OL,11,FThe Cardiff-born actor said he loved
OL,12,Fthe film series as a child and playing
OL,13,Fone of the lead roles was "very
OL,14,Fexciting".
OL,16,FStar Wars: Gobaith Newydd - based on
OL,17,Fthe original 1977 film Star Wars
OL,18,FEpisode IV: A New Hope - was given its
OL,19,Ffirst showing at a red-carpet event in
OL,20,FCardiff on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
