OL,3,AStar Wars actor 'thrilled' to voice the
OL,4,AWelsh Luke Skywalker
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dubbed Welsh version, featuring
OL,7,Factors Matthew Rhys and Rhys Ifans,
OL,8,Fwill be broadcast publicly for the
OL,9,Ffirst time by S4C on Christmas Day.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
